- Kick recorded dampened and open w/ Oktava MK220 (inside) and Neumann TLM 103 (outside). 
- Both snares were recorded w/ + w/o wires w/ Avantone CK-1 (top) Rode NT5 (underneath)
- toms recorded w/ SE Electronics 3 (w/ snare wires for natural kit sound or w/ no wires for cleaner timbre) 
- cymbals recorded w/ pair of AKG C415B (overheads)
